<title>USA: Lindsey - low inflation crucial to homeownership.</title>
<headline>Lindsey - low inflation crucial to homeownership.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Governor Lawrence Lindsey said Tuesday low inflation was critical for homeownership opportunities.</p>
<p>&quot;A low inflation environment is crucial to urban redevelopment and homeownership opportunities,&quot; Lindsey told a Women in Housing and Finance luncheon.</p>
</text>
